{
  "_comment": "Copy to projects.json. The console writes this file (Projects page) -- the entry below only shows the shape. A project scopes what its agents can reach: a data folder, an allowed model list, SQL tables and connectors. 'data_dir' is an absolute path on this machine. 'models': null means every loaded model is allowed; a list restricts the swarm to those names. Remove the 'sql' block if the project has no SQL source.",
